 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69yHlVmDdkkQ7kNvwEq9Ylt&_nc_oc=AdrdhTqVfP3v5hAszA9GKq9XVU5Kx0N8BZ1OaE-82dWwP2h8ywS3kvQBQeA9KaAM-r0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL60TdkPTuCucS5GX4-EbQZFW1at6hWByosaO_-wmq5cQ&oe=6ABE79C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=buNg3GcfYPMQ7kNvwFfIdON&_nc_oc=Adocb-yKcPOHIztqABB9oLxPjgKDxQXoYseccJDO5D2iarhNPPaOFmXQFKoGwChJJDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhBS6TADH_7K5YLBsBt7Cr5O03e57xiVGajFZ-UYwBAQ&oe=6ABE8726"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iGDptrJhPfQQ7kNvwHJ-im5&_nc_oc=Adr0U-N3uTSxAa8xbV3lX80EdEkuGVBSECTsnH98vXMl1H0DVgJRI3YESdntoATAhS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCICGO0Qv5Hq61mU_nRLuQBrCQZ_Fpdle9cszDk2_6iQ&oe=6ABE58DC"}, {"fil